{'symbol': 'ILMN', 'date': '2023-06-02 07:30:00', 'title': "ILLUMINA'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS ELECTS TWO EXPERIENCED INDEPENDENT DIRECTORS TO BOARD", 'text': "STEPHEN P. MACMILLAN, HOLOGIC CEO, NAMED NON-EXECUTIVE CHAIR OF ILLUMINA'S BOARD SCOTT B. ULLEM, CFO OF EDWARDS LIFESCIENCES, ALSO NAMED TO BOARD SAN DIEGO , JUNE 2, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ILLUMINA, INC.\xa0(NASDAQ: ILMN), A GLOBAL LEADER IN DNA SEQUENCING AND ARRAY-BASED TECHNOLOGIES, TODAY ANNOUNCED A SERIES OF GOVERNANCE CHANGES CONSISTENT WITH THE GOAL OF ENHANCING LONG-TERM SHAREHOLDER VALUE."}